# Paths markdownlint does not lint.
#
# Deliberately short. A long ignore file is how a linter stops being a gate,
# one exception at a time, so anything added here needs a reason that is about
# the FILE rather than about the rule being inconvenient.

# Vendored or generated Markdown, if any ever lands. Nothing matches today; the
# entry exists so the first generated file is not linted as though a human
# wrote it.
**/vendor/**
**/node_modules/**

# The worktree directory holds checkouts of OTHER branches of this same
# repository. Linting those from here would report findings against a commit
# that is not the one being checked, and each of those branches lints its own
# tree anyway.
.worktrees/**
